    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The showcase of student donuts and other 3d models from their stemmersion class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through an art gallery filled with their donut renders from the blender donut tutorial and other 3d models inspired by the other half of their stemmersion... fencing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back every year to see the updated museum and new rooms that will be filled with new student creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this walking sim you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walk up to &quot;paintings&quot; to see their title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >admire the variety of 3d models created by students</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to fancy music as you saunter around the museum</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The showcase of student donuts and other 3d models from their stemmersion class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through an art gallery filled with their donut renders from the blender donut tutorial and other 3d models inspired by the other half of their stemmersion... fencing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back every year to see the updated museum and new rooms that will be filled with new student creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this walking sim you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >walk up to &quot;paintings&quot; to see their title</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >admire the variety of 3d models created by students</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to fancy music as you saunter around the museum</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The showcase of student donuts and other 3d models from their stemmersion class. Walk through an art gallery filled with their donut renders from the blender donut tutorial and other 3d models inspired by the other half of their stemmersion... fencing! Come back every year to see an updated museum",
